{"id":"00158","root":"uni00158_1","name":{"ja":"ユーリヤ","en":"Yulia"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"ユーリヤ","en":"Yulia"},"aliases":["Julia"],"element":"Devilish","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2019-01-31","limited":false,"characterId":128,"profile":{"ja":"魔界で活動している暗殺者。ターゲットに近づき、知らぬうちに抹殺することができる。そのお陰で暗殺者は皆からミストという名で呼ばれて有名である。人間界でも魔族との繋がり深い所では名前がちらほらと流れており、政財界からミストに暗殺依頼をお願いしたいというものまでいる。だがその正体はブラック直属の部隊所属でノマドの幹部だけしか知らない。ミストの仕事内容から男だと思われているが、彼女の正体は高校生並の女の子である。現在はブラックの指示により、魔界出身の出稼ぎ労働者と身分を偽って、まえさき市の繁華街に潜入している。普段は派遣ハウスキーパーとして働きつつ、ブラックの指令に従って情報を集めたり暗殺をしたりしている。周囲に自分の正体を悟られないために、普段は別の人格が現れるようにあらかじめ自分自身に暗示をかけており、ブラックからの指令が届いたり、身に危険が迫った時のみ元の冷酷な暗殺者としての人格に戻る。","en":"Yulia is an assassin operating in the Demon Realm. She can approach a target unnoticed and eliminate them without their awareness, earning her the nickname \"Mist\" among fellow assassins. Her reputation has spread to the Human Realm, especially in circles with strong demon connections, and even political and business figures have sought to commission the Mist for killings. In truth, she belongs to a unit directly under Black, known only to the Nomad executives. Though many assume the Mist to be male because of the nature of the work, she is actually a teenage girl. Currently, under Black's orders, she masquerades as a migrant laborer from the Demon Realm and has infiltrated the bustling district of Maesaki City. She works as a temporary housekeeper while gathering intelligence and carrying out assassinations per Black's directives. To conceal her true identity, she pre-programs herself with a separate personality that appears in everyday life, only reverting to her cold, lethal assassin persona when a Black command arrives or danger looms."},"illustrator":"柄あゆり","voiceActor":"北板利亜","forms":[{"id":"uni00158_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1036,2073],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[135,270],"def":[109,219],"spd":[76,76],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","1